---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy & Cookie Policy"
  description="Howloop privacy policy covering local browser calculations, Google AdSense advertising cookies, optional analytics consent, and Australian privacy principles."
>
  <div class="hl-wrap hl-prose-wrap">
    <article class="hl-prose">
      <h1>Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 2026 · <strong>Domain:</strong> <a href={SITE.url}>{SITE.domain}</a></p>

      <div class="hl-policy-callout">
        <strong>Privacy Summary:</strong> Financial numbers you type into Howloop calculators (salary, savings balances, mortgage amounts, or 13-week cash-flow plans) are processed locally inside your browser. We do not transmit your calculator inputs to a central database.
      </div>

      <h2>1. Calculator Inputs &amp; Device-Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        All interactive calculators on {SITE.name} execute client-side in your web browser. If you explicitly choose to save a scenario or 13-week payday plan, that data is stored only in your browser's local storage (<code>localStorage</code>) on your own device and can be cleared or exported to CSV at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Google AdSense &amp; Third-Party Advertising Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google AdSense to display advertisements on select informational and tool pages. In accordance with <a href="https://support.google.com/adsense/answer/1348695" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google AdSense Required Privacy Content Policies</a>, please note:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the internet.</li>
        <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables Google and its partners to serve advertisements to our users based on their visit to {SITE.domain} and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
        <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">www.aboutads.info/choices</a>.</li>
        <li>To understand how Google collects and processes data when you visit sites that use Google services, please review <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="analytics-choices">3. Optional Analytics &amp; Consent Controls</h2>
      <p>
        Optional Google Analytics remains disabled by default until you explicitly opt in via our privacy banner. If you decline or revoke consent, accessible analytics cookies are cleared from your browser.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Server Logs &amp; Security</h2>
      <p>
        Our static hosting provider (Cloudflare Pages) automatically processes standard HTTP request metadata (IP address, user-agent string, and requested URL) solely for network routing, DDoS mitigation, and security monitoring.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy inquiries, data questions, or policy feedback, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact &amp; Feedback</a> page.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
